<title>SINGAPORE: Asia Naphtha/Mogas - Singapore markets closed.</title>
<headline>Asia Naphtha/Mogas - Singapore markets closed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore physical oil products market is closed on Friday for the Good Friday holiday. The market will reopen on Monday, March 31.</p>
<p>This is how the light distillates markets ended on Thursday;</p>
<p>(Prices are in dollars per barrel)</p>
<p> MTH  FOB SIN		    BUY/SELL     PREV BUY/SELL</p>
<p> APR  NAPHTHA		  24.05/24.25	24.05/24.25</p>
<p> APR  NAPHTHA SWAPS	  22.85/23.10	22.95/23.10</p>
<p> MAY  NAPHTHA SWAPS	  22.60/22.90	22.60/22.80</p>
<p> APR  GASOLINE 95 UNL	28.25/28.50	28.25/28.50</p>
<p> APR  GASOLINE SWAPS	 - - -/- - -	- - -/- - -</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
